🧠 AI Misinformation Checker

A modern web app built with HTML, TailwindCSS, and JavaScript that uses Google’s Gemini AI model (with integrated Google Search) to fact-check text or URLs in real-time.

This project allows users to verify if a statement or article contains verified, misleading, or unverified information — displayed clearly with AI-powered reasoning and credible sources.

🚀 Features

✅ Text & URL Input — Paste text or a webpage link to fact-check.
✅ AI Verification — Uses Google’s Gemini model (gemini-2.5-flash-preview-05-20) with web search for contextual validation.
✅ Structured Results — Clearly labeled Verdict and Analysis.
✅ Source Attribution — Displays credible URLs used by the model.
✅ Retry Handling — Automatically retries API calls on rate-limit errors (status 429).

🏗️ Tech Stack
Component	Technology
Frontend	HTML5, TailwindCSS
Logic	Vanilla JavaScript (async/await + Fetch API)
AI Model	Google Gemini 2.5 Flash Preview
Integration	Gemini Generative Language API + Google Search Tool

