⚙️ Setup & Usage
1️⃣ Clone the repository:
      git clone https://github.com/AjayDXavier/Misinformation-Check.git
      cd Misinformation-Check
2️⃣ Open in your browser
      Simply open the index.html file in any browser — no local server required.

🧩 How It Works
1. User enters text or URL.
2.The app builds a fact-check prompt and sends it to the Gemini API.
3.Gemini performs web search grounding using Google Search.
4.The response is parsed and displayed with:
    ->Verdict: Verified / Misleading / Unverified
    ->Analysis: Supporting or contradictory evidence
    ->Sources: Relevant references
